{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34770","headline":"过张祜处士丹阳故居 · 颜萱","name":"过张祜处士丹阳故居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昔爲儿逐我兄，曾抛竹马拜先生。\n书斋已换当时主，诗壁空题故友名。\n岂是争权留怨敌，可怜当路尽公卿。\n柴扉草屋无人问，犹向荒田责地征。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"颜萱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34770.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34770","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗鼓吹》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鼔吹_(四庫全書本)）"}